ace </span><span begin="00:37.440" end="00:38.010">inside</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.010" end="00:50.610"><span begin="00:38.010" end="00:38.190">that </span><span begin="00:38.190" end="00:38.280">is </span><span begin="00:38.280" end="00:38.550">so </span><span begin="00:38.550" end="00:38.940">hard </span><span begin="00:38.940" end="00:39.180">to </span><span begin="00:39.180" end="00:40.110">reach</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.610" end="00:52.710"><span begin="00:50.610" end="00:51.330">Father </span><span begin="00:51.330" end="00:51.510">of </span><span begin="00:51.510" end="00:52.320">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.710" end="00:55.200"><span begin="00:52.710" end="00:53.010">Tell </span><span begin="00:53.010" end="00:53.100">me </span><span begin="00:53.100" end="00:53.460">where </span><span begin="00:53.460" end="00:53.640">did </span><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:53.940">you </span><span begin="00:53.940" end="00:54.810">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.200" end="00:57.750"><span begin="00:55.200" end="00:55.470">Yeah </span><span begin="00:55.470" end="00:55.620">you </span><span begin="00:55.620" end="00:55.920">had </span><span begin="00:55.920" end="00:56.010">the </span><span begin="00:56.010" end="00:56.520">world </span><span begin="00:56.520" end="00:57.120">inside </span><span begin="00:57.120" end="00:57.330">your </span><span begin="00:57.330" end="00:57.570">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.750" end="01:00.510"><span begin="00:57.750" end="00:57.990">But </span><span begin="00:57.990" end="00:58.080">you </span><span begin="00:58.080" end="00:58.350">did </span><span begin="00:58.350" end="00:58.680">not </span><span begin="00:58.680" end="00:59.040">seem </span><span begin="00:59.040" end="00:59.160">to </span><span begin="00:59.160" end="01:00.000">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.510" end="01:02.610"><span begin="01:00.510" end="01:01.170">Father </span><span begin="01:01.170" end="01:01.380">of </span><span begin="01:01.380" end="01:02.130">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.610" end="01:05.070"><span begin="01:02.610" end="01:02.880">Tell </span><span begin="01:02.880" end="01:02.970">me </span><span begin="01:02.970" end="01:03.300">what </span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:03.450">do </span><span begin="01:03.450" end="01:03.720">you </span><span begin="01:03.720" end="01:04.710">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.070" end="01:07.650"><span begin="01:05.070" end="01:05.340">When </span><span begin="01:05.340" end="01:05.490">you </span><span begin="01:05.490" end="01:05.760">look </span><span begin="01:05.760" end="01:06.150">back </span><span begin="01:06.150" end="01:06.300">at </span><span begin="01:06.300" end="01:06.480">your </span><span begin="01:06.480" end="01:07.140">wasted </span><span begin="01:07.140" end="01:07.620">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.650" end="01:09.810"><span begin="01:07.650" end="01:07.830">And </span><span begin="01:07.830" end="01:07.920">you </span><span begin="01:07.920" end="01:08.250">don't </span><span begin="01:08.250" end="01:08.520">see </span><span begin="01:08.520" end="01:09.180">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.810" end="01:12.570"><span begin="01:09.810" end="01:10.080">I </span><span begin="01:10.080" end="01:10.380">was </span><span begin="01:10.380" end="01:10.980">ten </span><span begin="01:10.980" end="01:11.460">years </span><span begin="01:11.460" end="01:12.330">old</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.570" end="01:14.970"><span begin="01:12.570" end="01:12.960">Doing </span><span begin="01:12.960" end="01:13.230">all </span><span begin="01:13.230" end="01:13.440">that </span><span begin="01:13.440" end="01:13.620">i </span><span begin="01:13.620" end="01:14.550">could</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.970" end="01:17.730"><span begin="01:14.970" end="01:15.390">Wasn't </span><span begin="01:15.390" end="01